OL,3,ALegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,4,AStewart dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FStar Trek actor Sir Patrick Stewart has
OL,7,Fdied aged 86
OL,9,FHe died at his home in Los Angeles on
OL,10,FWednesday, according to a statement
OL,11,Fshared on his social media
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
